Source: vintner-boot
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: zcomputerwiz <zcomputerwiz@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: vintner-core
Architecture: all
Description: vintner boot platform - core tools, publisher and health checks
 Common boot metadata schema, manifest validation, state model, CLI and
 API. Contains the publisher (kernel and initramfs hooks, image build,
 verification and signing, atomic staging and garbage collection), the
 health checks and the BIOS blessing service.

Package: vintner-platform
Architecture: all
Description: vintner boot platform - inert boot loader and recovery payloads
 Platform payloads installed under /usr/lib/vintner/payloads/: the
 systemd-boot and shim binaries, the GRUB core image and modules, and the
 recovery images. Installing or upgrading this package never touches the
 ESP, boot storage or NVRAM; only an explicit, signed
 "vintner platform-update" deploys a payload.

Package: vintner-installer
Architecture: all
Description: vintner boot platform - installation integration
 Guided and automated installation integration: partition setup,
 firmware probe and boot entry registration. A udeb follows later.
